46,0 $ Cap cuticle bitterish, + NaOH bright red to purplish-red (cap pale to deep blue-violaceous discolouring  ochraceous or buff from disc outwards, not innately fibrillose; spores amygdali form to sublimoniform,  10-12/5½-6½ µm ) $ sodagnitus (39)
