7,8 $ Gills lilac or blue-violaceous at first as well as cap and stem; flesh blue- violaceous or whitish,  sometimes pallid or rusty-yellowish in part; smell of goats, burnt horn or sweat
7,0 $ Blue colours confined to stem and sometimes cap margin at first; gills yellow-ochraceous at first  then ± rusty; flesh pallid-yellowish in cap, deeper ochraceous or rusty in stem; smell sickly  sweet or of acetylene $ traganus (112)
