8,0 $ Flesh lilac or blue-violaceous becoming whitish or cream-colour in the stem; cap and stem  lilac or blue-violaceous, only becoming sl. pallid or brownish in places; smell penetrating  of sweat or raw potato; spores elliptic-oblong, 11/5½ µm  sec Henry; (cap 50-70 mm.;  stem ± clavate, 60-80/15 or more mm., woolly peronate at first)  * ($camphoratus(FR.) Fr. S. Henry non Ricken)
